    <deftitle>EDC16C31 361830</deftitle>
    <description>BMW Bin Editor v1.18 known-good XDF baseline with the 2026-08-18 full shared-controller retrace. The stale FA828-as-boost block was removed. 2026-10-03 N75 scaling correction: the four F7F44/F8478/F86BC/F8900 base maps and distinct FA3DC upper-command-bound contributor use native-command percent (100/8192)*X. Historical boost/N75 ownership of the F75D4 shared-controller block through 0x84A9C8 is retired: that instruction loads unrelated RAM0x3FDD28 and the following instruction stores RAM0x3FA650; shared-controller ownership remains unverified. Slot 0x6E8 / BIN 0xFA828 is separately identified as the rail-pressure controller through caller 0x84D2A8 and the FA872 no-start experiment. The shared routine implements base/precontrol, a base-command delta/transient term, and a scheduled persistent integrator factor; no separate textbook proportional-gain scalar is promoted. All unresolved coefficient engineering scalings remain raw. Original calibration bytes are not changed by this XDF.</description>
    <author>Emil</author>
