Selector: default / any 0x70 pattern other than 0x10,0x30,0x40,0x50; selected record offset +0x000. The map-4/map-5 ordering is code-proven and intentionally non-monotonic.

Downstream: After the selected base lookup, mode byte [r13-30235]==2 overrides it with an 8x8 lookup at module+0xC1A (FLS 0xEB3E2, call 0x4099C). The result then receives scaling/additive corrections at 0x409C8-0x409F0, a 2-D correction lookup at module+0xB54 (call 0x40A18), a 1-D correction at module+0xBF8 (call 0x40A3C), then further clamps/arbitration.

