    <description>AUDIT 2026-10-03 - Classification: code-confirmed bounded source check. FLS runtime 0x83C75C looks up record FA398, Z at file offset FA3DC. In pressure-controller state 1, 0x83C764..0x83C770 adds this result to a separately scheduled signed offset with signed-16 saturation; r26 is the resulting upper command bound. The base-plus-controller command is clipped against this upper bound and the FA5DC lower bound before output RAM0x3FA686 is stored. FA3DC is a bound contributor, not a fifth interchangeable base/feed-forward map, a direct additive controller correction, or a P/I/D gain. State 0 passes the same record to a 1D helper whose interpretation remains unresolved. The state-1 load selector FA6B7 is zero in the checked original and r005, selecting internal RAM0x3FA62C rather than logged TestO IQ55 RAM0x3FA622; log IQ is only a qualified surrogate. Keep this record outside the N75 base linked-edit group. SCALING REVIEW 2026-10-03: Z is a signed native command contribution with full scale 8192; (100/8192)*X displays native-command percent, not TestO wire decoding or complemented electrical PWM. Matched original actuator curve E37D6 maps raw 4096 to logical 5000 and 8192 to 10000. Raw calibration values, signedness and axes are unchanged; this equation is not a generic 0..100 clamp.</description>
